{"cut_proposal":{"candidate_errors":[],"prefix":"To determine how many positive multiples of 13 are three-digit integers, we need to find the smallest and largest three-digit multiples of 13 and then count the numbers in this range.\n\n1. **Find the smallest three-digit multiple of 13:**\n   - The smallest three-digit number is 100.\n   - We need to find the smallest integer \\( n \\) such that \\( 13n \\geq 100 \\).\n   - Dividing 100 by 13 gives \\( \\frac{100}{13} \\approx 7.6923 \\).\n   - Since \\( n \\) must be an integer, we round up to the next whole number, which is 8.\n   - Therefore, the smallest three-digit multiple of 13 is \\( 13 \\times 8 = 104 \\).\n\n2. **Find the largest three-digit multiple of 13:**\n   - The largest three-digit number is 999.\n   - We need to find the largest integer \\( m \\) such that \\( 13m \\leq 999 \\).\n   - Dividing 999 by 13 gives \\( \\frac{999}{13} \\approx 76.8462 \\).\n   - Since \\( m \\) must be an integer, we round down to the nearest whole number, which is 76.\n   - Therefore, the largest three-digit multiple of 13 is \\( 13 \\times 76 = 988 \\).\n\n","prefix_end":1027,"status":"review_required"},"eligible":false,"generation":{"generation":{"max_new_tokens":2048,"temperature":0.7,"top_k":0,"top_p":1.0},"ids":[1249,8253,1246,1657,6785,65060,315,220,16,18,525,2326,48342,25780,11,582,1184,311,1477,279,24632,323,7772,2326,48342,65060,315,220,16,18,323,1221,1760,279,5109,304,419,2088,382,16,13,3070,9885,279,24632,2326,48342,5248,315,220,16,18,25,1019,256,481,576,24632,2326,48342,1372,374,220,16,15,15,624,256,481,1205,1184,311,1477,279,24632,7546,17767,308,1124,8,1741,429,17767,220,16,18,77,1124,709,80,220,16,15,15,1124,4292,256,481,8765,6577,220,16,15,15,553,220,16,18,6696,17767,1124,37018,90,16,15,15,15170,16,18,92,1124,48053,220,22,13,21,24,17,18,1124,4292,256,481,8704,17767,308,1124,8,1969,387,458,7546,11,582,4778,705,311,279,1790,4361,1372,11,892,374,220,23,624,256,481,15277,11,279,24632,2326,48342,5248,315,220,16